{{#example center=true surface=true style="padding-block: 3rem"}}
<span class="im-logo" style="--im-logo-size: 4.5rem"><b class="im-logo-type">Im</b><i class="im-logo-dot"></i></span>
{{/example}}

<p>The dot is a <strong>recording light</strong>: the site is on air, somebody is publishing. It sits at the <em>cap line</em> of the last letter, never above it and never beside its middle, and it is the accent — so the one coloured thing in the header is the same colour as the one coloured thing everywhere else.</p>

<h2>The wordmark</h2>
<p>Any name. The dot lands on the last letter whatever that letter is: the shoulder of an <b>l</b>, the right stem of an <b>m</b>, the bowl of an <b>o</b>.</p>
{{#example center=true}}
<span class="im-logo" style="--im-logo-size: 2.75rem"><b class="im-logo-type">Swarnil</b><i class="im-logo-dot"></i></span>
<span class="im-logo" style="--im-logo-size: 2.75rem"><b class="im-logo-type">Im</b><i class="im-logo-dot"></i></span>
<span class="im-logo" style="--im-logo-size: 2.75rem"><b class="im-logo-type">Studio</b><i class="im-logo-dot"></i></span>
{{/example}}
{{{{code "hbs"}}}}
{{> "components/logo"}}                    {{!-- the site's title --}}
{{> "components/logo" text="Swarnil"}}
{{> "components/logo" size="3rem" live=true}}
{{{{/code}}}}

<h2>The square</h2>
<p>The first letter on a tile, with the same dot in the same place. For a favicon, an avatar, an island bar, an app icon, a phone — anywhere the name will not fit. The radius is a <strong>share of the tile</strong> (28%), so the shape holds at 20px and at 200px; a fixed radius makes a small mark look square and a large one look like a pill.</p>
{{#example center=true}}
<span class="im-logo im-logo-mark" style="--im-logo-size: 5rem"><b class="im-logo-type">I</b><i class="im-logo-dot"></i></span>
<span class="im-logo im-logo-mark im-logo-outline" style="--im-logo-size: 5rem"><b class="im-logo-type">S</b><i class="im-logo-dot"></i></span>
<span class="im-logo im-logo-mark im-logo-accent" style="--im-logo-size: 5rem"><b class="im-logo-type">S</b><i class="im-logo-dot"></i></span>
{{/example}}
